","accept":["TABLE","ATABLE"]},{"label":"Riddle 3 (Intel)","accept":["COIN","ACOIN"]}]'::jsonb, false, 3, 200, 'Think of everyday objects. Answers are short nouns. Answers start with: CO…, TA…, CO…', 'COMB: a comb | TABLE: a table | COIN: a coin', null, 25, 'published'), ('mission-riddle-3', 'riddle', 'mission', 'Riddle Room', 'riddle', 1, array['any','learning','office','social','hr','glass']::text[], 'Each teammate holds one riddle. Answer all three — one or two words each.', '{"scout":{"title":"Riddle 1","body":"What has one eye but cannot see? You use it with thread.\n\n(6 letters · starts with N)","mono":false,"big":false},"decoder":{"title":"Riddle 2","body":"What falls from the sky but never gets hurt? You need an umbrella.\n\n(4 letters · starts with R)","mono":false,"big":false},"intel":{"title":"Riddle 3","body":"What has many pages and words but never speaks?\n\n(4 letters · starts with B)","mono":false,"big":false}}'::jsonb, '[{"label":"Riddle 1 (Scout)","accept":["NEEDLE","ANEEDLE"]},{"label":"Riddle 2 (Decoder)","accept":["RAIN"]},{"label":"Riddle 3 (Intel)","accept":["BOOK","ABOOK"]}]'::jsonb, false, 3, 200, 'Think of everyday objects. Answers are short nouns. Answers start with: NE…, RA…, BO…', 'NEEDLE: a needle | RAIN: rain | BOOK: a book', null, 25, 'published'), ('mission-riddle-4', 'riddle', 'mission', 'Riddle Room', 'riddle', 1, array['any','learning','office','social','hr','glass']::text[], 'Each teammate holds one riddle. Answer all three — one or two words each.', '{"scout":{"title":"Riddle 1","body":"I ring, I have a screen, and you carry me everywhere.\n\n(5 letters · starts with P)","mono":false,"big":false},"decoder":{"title":"Riddle 2","body":"I am full of holes but still hold water. I clean dishes.\n\n(6 letters · starts with S)","mono":false,"big":false},"intel":{"title":"Riddle 3","body":"What goes up when you get older, and never comes down?\n\n(3 letters · starts with A)","mono":false,"big":false}}'::jsonb, '[{"label":"Riddle 1 (Sco