en + snowman | SPIDERMAN: spider + man', null, 25, 'published'), ('mission-movie-2', 'movie', 'mission', 'Emoji Cinema', 'movies', 1, array['any','social','food','costa','sports','public']::text[], 'Each teammate holds a movie told in emoji. Name all three films.', '{"scout":{"title":"Film 1","body":"🔍 🐠\n\n(2 words: 7 + 4 · starts with F)","mono":false,"big":true},"decoder":{"title":"Film 2","body":"🧸 📖\n\n(2 words: 3 + 5 · starts with T)","mono":false,"big":true},"intel":{"title":"Film 3","body":"3️⃣ 🤪 🎓\n\n(2 words: 1 + 6 · starts with 3)","mono":false,"big":true}}'::jsonb, '[{"label":"Film 1 (Scout)","accept":["FINDINGNEMO","NEMO"]},{"label":"Film 2 (Decoder)","accept":["TOYSTORY"]},{"label":"Film 3 (Intel)","accept":["3IDIOTS","THREEIDIOTS"]}]'::jsonb, false, 3, 200, 'Mix of Hollywood and Indian blockbusters. Spelling of "The" is optional. Answers start with: FI…, TO…, 3 …', 'FINDING NEMO: finding + fish | TOY STORY: toy + story | 3 IDIOTS: three idiots at college', null, 25, 'published'), ('mission-movie-3', 'movie', 'mission', 'Emoji Cinema', 'movies', 1, array['any','social','food','costa','sports','public']::text[], 'Each teammate holds a movie told in emoji. Name all three films.', '{"scout":{"title":"Film 1","body":"🤼‍♀️ 👨‍👧‍👧 🥇\n\n(6 letters · starts with D)","mono":false,"big":true},"decoder":{"title":"Film 2","body":"⚡ 🧙‍♂️ 👓\n\n(2 words: 5 + 6 · starts with H)","mono":false,"big":true},"intel":{"title":"Film 3","body":"🦈 🌊 🏊\n\n(4 letters · starts with J)","mono":false,"big":true}}'::jsonb, '[{"label":"Film 1 (Scout)","accept":["DANGAL"]},{"label":"Film 2 (Decoder)","accept":["HARRYPOTTER"]},{"label":"Film 3 (Intel)","accept":["JAWS"]}]'::jsonb, false, 3, 200, 'Mix of Hollywood and Indian blockbusters. Spelling of "The" is optional. Answers start with: DA…, HA…, JA…', 'DANGAL: wrestling father and daughters | HARRY POTTER: scar, wizard, glasses | JAWS: shark attack', null, 25, 'published') on conflict (id) do update set family = excluded.family, kind 