 final total (it may be over 21 — a bust)."}}'::jsonb, '[{"label":"Dealer’s final total","accept":["19"]}]'::jsonb, false, 5, 120, 'Add one card at a time and check the total after each card.', '7♥ + 2♣ + 3♥ + 7♦ = 19 (stops at 18+)', null, 25, 'published'), ('mission-cardsharp-0', 'cardsharp', 'mission', 'Card Sharp', 'cards', 1, array['any','office','learning','social','glass']::text[], 'Six cards lie face up. Intel knows which three count, Decoder knows how to score them. Add up the score.', '{"scout":{"title":"The table (left to right)","body":"1: 7♠   2: Q♠   3: 9♦   4: 9♠   5: K♠   6: K♥","cards":["7♠","Q♠","9♦","9♠","K♠","K♥"]},"intel":{"title":"Cards that count","body":"Positions 1, 4, 5 (counting from the LEFT).","big":true},"decoder":{"title":"Scoring","body":"A=1, J=11, Q=12, K=13. RED cards (♥ ♦) count DOUBLE."}}'::jsonb, '[{"label":"Total score","accept":["29"]}]'::jsonb, false, 3, 200, 'Scout reads out the three cards Intel names; Decoder scores each one; the captain adds.', '7♠=7 + 9♠=9 + K♠=13 = 29 (red ×2)', null, 25, 'published'), ('mission-cardsharp-1', 'cardsharp', 'mission', 'Card Sharp', 'cards', 1, array['any','office','learning','social','glass']::text[], 'Six cards lie face up. Intel knows which three count, Decoder knows how to score them. Add up the score.', '{"scout":{"title":"The table (left to right)","body":"1: J♥   2: 3♣   3: 6♠   4: A♣   5: 9♠   6: 3♠","cards":["J♥","3♣","6♠","A♣","9♠","3♠"]},"intel":{"title":"Cards that count","body":"Positions 2, 3, 6 (counting from the LEFT).","big":true},"decoder":{"title":"Scoring","body":"A=1, J=11, Q=12, K=13. Every ♠ spade counts 0."}}'::jsonb, '[{"label":"Total score","accept":["3"]}]'::jsonb, false, 3, 200, 'Scout reads out the three cards Intel names; Decoder scores each one; the captain adds.', '3♣=3 + 6♠=0 + 3♠=0 = 3 (spades 0)', null, 25, 'published') on conflict (id) do update set family = excluded.family, kind = excluded.kind, title = excluded.title, category = excluded.category, diff